    "semanticOwnerId": "classical-relational-ic-in-fusion-with-absent-adjunct",
    "canvasSection": "§45.4.4.d",
    "canvasSpan": "18191–18193",
    "statement": "But the collocation īc in is used so frequently that when the clause that in should introduce is left unsaid, the in is fused to the īc.",
