    "semanticOwnerId": "classical-adverbial-adjunction-concession-in-tla-nel",
    "canvasSection": "§50.8",
    "canvasSpan": "21643–21645",
    "statement": "The introductory collocation in tlā nel, \"if in truth,\" may be translated \"even if,\" \"even if it were the case that,\" or \"even supposing that.\"",
