    "canvasSection": "§50.8",
    "canvasSpan": "21654–21656",
    "statement": "The incorporated-object, (tla-htlac-ō-l)-li-, \"damage, misdeed, defect, etc.,\" is an impersonal patientive nounstem from the verbstem…",
