    "canvasSection": "§52.6",
    "canvasSpan": "22405–22407",
    "statement": "For example, (nān)-tli-, \"mother,\" and (tah)-tli-, \"father,\" combine to create a lexical item that is translated \"parent/caregiver.\"",
