    "canvasSection": "§54.2.3.a",
    "canvasSpan": "23127–23128",
    "statement": "Occasionally, the base to which the ya is added has an i that does not belong to the root (i.e., the ya seems to be added to a stock; compare §…",
    "projectRole": "read-only-grammar-fact",
    "contentFingerprint": "fnv1a32:d23b32c6"
