    "semanticOwnerId": "classical-personal-name-nnc-passive-preterit-patientive",
    "canvasSection": "§56.2.1.f",
    "canvasSpan": "24332–24335",
    "statement": "When the stem of the personal-name NNC has its inner predicate formed on the passive voice, that stem is a preterit-patientive NNC (see § 35.3,…",
