    "canvasSection": "§56.2.2.a",
    "canvasSpan": "24402–24404",
    "statement": "The author's evaluative conclusion cannot authorize or suppress the participant roles, naming event, or causal left-handed proposition actually expressed by the quoted Nahuatl clause.",
