    "canvasSection": "§58.1",
    "canvasSpan": "25021–25023",
    "statement": "A number of instrumental nounstems are formed as compounds with the nounstem (āz)-tli-, \"a made thing, a thing with which to do s.th.,\" i.e.,…",
